			"date": "2023-01-20T12:00:00.000Z",
			"content": "<p>I say that as a dedicated fan of the project: This is my first post published after upgrading to the <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-version-two/\">new beta</a>!</p>\n<p>It was almost a no-touch upgrade. My partial that outputs photo galleries needed some love to eliminate extra whitespace, but aside from that I am upgraded and ready to start migrating to WebC.</p>",
