			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> For those of us that very rarely use npm, and have been poking about on the canary, how does one `npm update` and get the beta, instead of the latest Canary?</p>",
